    "ja": "やめないで、茶山くん"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Handsome CEO with a Scent Fetish × New Employee Who Highkey wants to Quit\n\nReaching the end of my day, completely worn out and drained. I need some rest but…\nhow did I end up taking care of the president whose sound asleep in front of my door?!\n\nChayama is a new employee who works overtime everyday. He's completely drained both physically and mentally with no time for romance and is considering changing jobs. After a devastating day, he returns home to find a drunken man laying on his doorstep?\nHe takes a closer look and realises this man was Kanoki, the president of his company!\nWithout a choice, he takes the drunken president in and looks after him. \nHowever, he eventually considers this to be a perfect opportunity for him!\nChayama tries to collect information on Kanoki's weaknesses to get rid of his demonic boss's attitude by persuading the president however…"
  },
